            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Enter the relay address."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Free trial" : {
      "comment" : "Row label on the home screen while the free trial runs. The row's value, on the right, is the end date.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kostenlose Testphase"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Free trial"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "From %@" : {
      "comment" : "First line of a large card on Home and History: a tab that arrived and was opened. %@ is the sending device's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Von %1$@"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "From %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "From your account page on %@." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of the reset card. %@ is the date the reset was asked for, such as \"October 27\".",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Beantragt auf deiner Kontoseite am %1$@."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "From your account page on %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "From your account page." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of the reset card when the date of the request is not known.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Von deiner Kontoseite."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "From your account page."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If it wasn't you, stop it now, then change your email password." : {
      "comment" : "Last sentence of the reset card. It tells the person what to do if someone else asked for the reset. The email password is the password of the email account used for the Tabsend account.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn du das nicht warst, stoppe es jetzt und ändere danach dein E-Mail-Passwort."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If it wasn't you, stop it now, then change your email password."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Incompatible protocol version." : {
      "comment" : "Fallback error when pairing is blocked by a version mismatch and no more specific message applies. Not normally shown.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Inkompatible Protokollversion."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Incompatible protocol version."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It joined %@ and is no longer in your list. Your relay may be hiding it. It could have read the links sent while it was listed. If you removed it yourself, you can dismiss this." : {
      "comment" : "Body of the card about a device that joined and then disappeared. \"It\" is the device named in the heading. %@ is how long ago it joined, such as \"3m ago\", \"just now\" or \"recently\". The relay is the server.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Es ist %1$@ beigetreten und steht nicht mehr in deiner Liste. Vielleicht blendet dein Relay es aus. Es könnte die Links gelesen haben, die gesendet wurden, solange es in der Liste stand. Wenn du es selbst entfernt hast, kannst du das ausblenden."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It joined %@ and is no longer in your list. Your relay may be hiding it. It could have read the links sent while it was listed. If you removed it yourself, you can dismiss this."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It joined your Tabsend devices %@. If that wasn't you, remove it in Tabsend." : {
      "comment" : "Notification body: one new device joined. \"It\" is the device named in the title. %@ is how long ago, such as \"3m ago\" or \"just now\".",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Es ist %1$@ zu deinen Tabsend-Geräten hinzugekommen. Wenn du das nicht warst, entferne es in Tabsend."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It joined your Tabsend devices %@. If that wasn't you, remove it in Tabsend."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It joined your Tabsend devices. If that wasn't you, remove it in Tabsend." : {
      "comment" : "Notification body: one new device joined and the time is not known. \"It\" is the device named in the title.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Es ist zu deinen Tabsend-Geräten hinzugekommen. Wenn du das nicht warst, entferne es in Tabsend."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It joined your Tabsend devices. If that wasn't you, remove it in Tabsend."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It was me" : {
      "comment" : "Button on the reset card for the person who asked for the reset themselves. It hides the card on this phone. Keep it short.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das war ich"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It was me"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Linked. A newer Tabsend build is available (this app speaks v%lld, the relay prefers v%lld). Everything works, but it's worth updating." : {
      "comment" : "Banner after pairing succeeded, when the relay prefers a newer app. The two numbers are protocol versions, not counts: \"v2\", \"v3\". Tabsend build means this app.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gekoppelt. Es gibt eine neuere Tabsend-Version (diese App nutzt v%1$lld, das Relay bevorzugt v%2$lld). Alles funktioniert, ein Update lohnt sich aber."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Linked. A newer Tabsend build is available (this app speaks v%1$lld, the relay prefers v%2$lld). Everything works, but it's worth updating."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move to another relay" : {
      "comment" : "Title of the move-to-another-relay sheet.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zu einem anderen Relay wechseln"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Move to another relay"
          }
        }
