          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nothing picked them up, and the relay has stopped holding them. Open Tabsend to see which, and to send them again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Now using %@." : {
      "comment" : "Banner on the home screen after the relay address was changed. %@ is the new address.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du nutzt jetzt %1$@."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Now using %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On %@ at %@, every device is removed, this one too." : {
      "comment" : "Second sentence of the reset card. The first %@ is the date, such as \"October 30\". The second %@ is the time of day, such as \"2:05 PM\".",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Am %1$@ um %2$@ Uhr werden alle Geräte entfernt, auch dieses."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On %1$@ at %2$@, every device is removed, this one too."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paste or scan a setup link created by that relay." : {
      "comment" : "Message on the first-run screen after switching to a different relay. A setup link is the pairing link a device already using Tabsend shows.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Füge einen Einrichtungslink von diesem Relay ein oder scanne ihn."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Paste or scan a setup link created by that relay."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Probably the same relay. It's too old to confirm, but it accepted this phone's login." : {
      "comment" : "Result on the move-to-another-relay sheet: the relay is too old to confirm its identity, but it accepted this phone's credentials.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wahrscheinlich dasselbe Relay. Es ist zu alt, um das zu bestätigen, hat aber die Anmeldung dieses Smartphones akzeptiert."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Probably the same relay. It's too old to confirm, but it accepted this phone's login."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Request failed (%lld)." : {
      "comment" : "Error shown when the relay answered with an error that has no readable message. %lld is the HTTP status number, such as 502, not a count.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Anfrage fehlgeschlagen (%1$lld)."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Request failed (%lld)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reset stopped. Nothing was removed." : {
      "comment" : "Banner on the home screen after the reset was stopped.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zurücksetzen gestoppt. Es wurde nichts entfernt."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reset stopped. Nothing was removed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Same relay. Your devices stay paired." : {
      "comment" : "Result on the move-to-another-relay sheet: the new address is the same relay as before, so nothing needs to be paired again.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dasselbe Relay. Deine Geräte bleiben gekoppelt."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Same relay. Your devices stay paired."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Send to…" : {
      "comment" : "Menu button on a waiting tab whose device is gone. Opens a list of the other devices the tab can go to. Keep it short.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Senden an…"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Send to…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sending is paused. We emailed you what to do next." : {
      "comment" : "Text of the amber card after the free trial ended. Says what happened and that an email has the next step. Names no price and has no button to pay.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das Senden ist pausiert. Wir haben dir per E-Mail geschickt, was jetzt zu tun ist."
