            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your relay has reached a limit for your group."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your relay has reached a limit for your group. This tab is queued and will send itself once there is room." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under a waiting send: the relay reached some limit for this group. The relay is the server.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Relay hat für deine Gruppe ein Limit erreicht. Dieser Tab steht in der Warteschlange und wird automatisch gesendet, sobald wieder Platz ist."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your relay has reached a limit for your group. This tab is queued and will send itself once there is room."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your relay has reached its device limit for your group. Remove a device you are not using, then pair this one again." : {
      "comment" : "Banner when pairing is refused because the group already has the most devices the relay allows. The relay is the server.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Relay hat für deine Gruppe die Obergrenze für Geräte erreicht. Entferne ein Gerät, das du nicht nutzt, und koppele dieses dann erneut."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your relay has reached its device limit for your group. Remove a device you are not using, then pair this one again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your relay is answering again." : {
      "comment" : "Notification body after waiting tabs were sent: the relay (the server that passes tabs between devices) is working again.",
      "localizations" : {
