          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your relay no longer has this group. Pair this phone again if you still have access."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your relay says %@ has left your group of devices." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under a failed send: the receiving device is no longer in the group. %@ is the device name, or \"that device\". The relay is the server.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Relay meldet, dass %1$@ deine Gruppe verlassen hat."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your relay says %@ has left your group of devices."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your relay wouldn't allow that. If your group is suspended, whoever runs the relay can lift the suspension." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation after a request failed: the relay refused permission. A group can be suspended on a relay, and only the person or company running the relay can lift that. The relay is the server.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Relay erlaubt das nicht. Ist deine Gruppe gesperrt, kann die Person, die das Relay betreibt, die Sperre aufheben."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your relay wouldn't allow that. If your group is suspended, whoever runs the relay can lift the suspension."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your relay wouldn't let this phone send to %@." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under a failed send: the relay refused permission. %@ is the device name, or \"that device\". The relay is the server.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Relay erlaubt diesem Smartphone nicht, an %1$@ zu senden."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your relay wouldn't let this phone send to %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "from %@" : {
      "comment" : "Part of a history row: this phone received the tab. %@ is the name of the sending device, such as \"Work laptop\".",
